  "limitations": [
    "Exact/normalized overlap establishes previously seen text, not the causal source or size of memorization.",
    "Original teacher manifest did not record source file hashes; current files match recorded row counts, the later v18 preparation hashes, and exactly reproduce persisted teacher split indices.",
    "All student internal test rows occur somewhere in historical teacher train/calibration/validation; 8152 of 10238 occur in teacher train. Student validation/calibration also overlap teacher train.",
    "Prepared lineage exclusion cannot erase knowledge already present in teacher weights transferred to the student.",
    "Cached comparison is a previously inspected development set; it does not establish prospective release performance. No threshold was fitted in this audit.",
    "Small per-language denominators and absent template/translation metadata limit generalization; source/family correlation limits row-independent uncertainty estimates.",
    "Input reliable-label gate excludes some labels; recall slices describe binary detection through allowed predicted labels, not detection of stateful or tool-context attacks."
  ]
